    "string_value": "Source: 'GW imaging stats.xlsx', sent by Peter Walian to John-Marc Chandonia on 2020-04-17 (copy in the package's source/ folder), described by him as the average number of microbes per EM grid window observed in groundwater from three wells over the five Spring 2019 timepoints; the raw observation tallies are in a student lab notebook at Donner"
