    "scalar_type": "string",
    "string_value": "Category 'microbes' is the sheet's unlabelled upper table (columns headed only GW821, MLS and 'Area3 FW100'); it is not the sum of the other categories (for GW821E it is below 'large cells' alone). 'large cells', 'ultra-small cells' and 'phage' are the three tables headed 'Valerie results (entries below are average observations per EM grid window for each of the 5 sampling dates)', labelled 'large cells', 'UMBs' and 'Phage'; the FW100 column of the large-cells table carries the remark 'small large!'"
